          "description": "Knowledge-checking questions that ask the student to demonstrate subject-matter knowledge by giving an answer, explanation, prediction, calculation, or solution. Exclude rhetorical or tutor-answered questions, heading titles, self-report understanding checks such as \"Have you understood?\" or \"Does that make sense?\", invitations for questions, and learning-preference or continuation questions. Include hidden questions in a clearly knowledge-checking quiz when explicit counters or pagination establish the total, including the visible question once. Do not infer knowledge-checking intent from a question mark alone."
        }
