      ],
      "description": "Captured interaction states are supporting views of the original containing section, not additional sections or additional components. A quiz with three questions remains three questions when the learner selects an answer, views feedback, or navigates Previous/Next. Count each question/image in that component once across its supporting views. Separate components in the same section remain separate; do not deduplicate merely by matching text. Supporting-view captions and capture metadata do not count as headings."
